<title>USA: Southwest Water sees continued earns growth.</title>
<headline>Southwest Water sees continued earns growth.</headline>
<dateline>WEST COVINA, Calif. 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Southwest Water Co said on Monday that it is positioned for a fourth consecutive year of revenue and earnings growth in 1997.</p>
<p>The company reported a 33-percent increase in earnings per share and a 16-percent rise in revenue in 1996.</p>
<p>Southwest said its &quot;basic fundamentals for progress are in place.&quot; after reporting its best first quarter since 1992.</p>
<p>&quot;We are well on our way to another strong year,&quot; Southwest president Anton Garnier said.</p>
</text>
